["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"The Brutal History of The First Warplanes Pusher Tractor Interrupter gear Scout Flying circus\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-27-historyhit-一战空战浪漫背后-新飞行员平均活两周/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/4fac589db0b89acd-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"D\"><span class=\"dur\">50:55</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">History Hit</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0827</span></div>\n<h2>一戰空戰不是浪漫，是平均活兩週的絞肉機</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">一戰開始時，飛機還被軍官層當作玩笑；短短四年，天空變成偵察、轟炸、格鬥的絞肉機，1917年新飛行員的平均壽命只有約兩週。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">一戰空戰</span><span class=\"tag\">技術迭代</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"700. The Troubles: Bloody Sunday (Part 4) Direct Rule Special Category Status Provisional IRA\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-26-restishistory-英国当年几乎随时接受类似-贝尔法斯特协议-的安排/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/4d082c6220b28920-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:24:07</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">The Rest Is History</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0826</span></div>\n<h2>英國當年幾乎隨時接受類似《貝爾法斯特協議》的安排</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">1972年希思內閣已把終止分治、與愛爾蘭建立憲法聯繫等選項擺上桌；不是英國頑固，而是IRA的暴力升級讓和平窗口一再關上。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>3</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">北愛衝突</span><span class=\"tag\">歷史政治</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Eric Weinstein: The State of American Science, Breakthrough Coverups, and the Danger of Physics peer review reference committee geometric unity adS/CFT trash can corpus UAP\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-26-allin-同行评审是1965年后编出来的-物理学1984年一夜转向/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/1450f83007b964ee-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">1:30:20</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">All-In</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0826</span></div>\n<h2>同行評審是1965年後編出來的，物理學1984年一夜轉向</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Weinstein 說同行評審是1965年後被追認出來的假故事，物理學在1983到1984年間一夜轉向安全的方向，而停滯可能救了人類。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">科學資助</span><span class=\"tag\">同行評審</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"AI Lattice Proofs with Chris Peikert CVP SVP Dihedral coset problem Reed-Solomon code Information set decoding Doubly efficient PIR\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-26-securitycrypto-ai-证明封死-cvp-近似困难-gap-但不烧密码学/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/a0ce9b13c93eb0a9-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">50:44</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Security Cryptography Whatever</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0826</span></div>\n<h2>AI 證明逼近平方根障礙：格密碼最壞情況仍安全</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">OpenAI 模型證明 CVP 在 n 的 1/400 次方近似下仍 NP-hard，幾天內被推到平方根；SVP 指數改進到 2^0.7n、McEliece 遭準多項式攻擊，但現實格密碼因維度膨脹和近似因子 gap 暫安全。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">格密碼</span><span class=\"tag\">後量子密碼</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"#501 – DHH: Future of Programming, AI, Agentic Engineering, Vibe Coding &amp; Linux vibe coding agentic engineering harness fast takeoff bullshit jobs\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-26-lex-程序员的价值从写码转向调度-agent/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/d67cbc9ec26fc241-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"L\"><span class=\"dur\">5:21:57</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Lex Fridman</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0826</span></div>\n<h2>程序員價值轉向調度 agent：DHH 用 AI 寫完整個產品</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">DHH 已用 AI 寫 Omachi 的全部代碼，並發現反直覺結論：agent 不需要囉嗦指令，需要並行運行；真正稀缺的是判斷、審美與架構約束。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 編程</span><span class=\"tag\">Agent</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"No Co-Founder, No Degree, $41.5M to Fix AI Data Centers | Zach Laberge, Omen neocloud preempted advisory shares fluid testing\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-26-solofounders-找不到完美的联合创始人-公司只能发挥一半实力/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/41c6a81757c3ece6-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">1:03:27</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">單人創始人</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0826</span></div>\n<h2>找不到完美的聯合創始人，公司只能發揮一半實力</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">他的判斷是：為湊一個聯合創始人而分股權不划算，沒有完美的合夥人，公司只能做到本該有的一半；而獨自創業逼他什麼都自己學，反倒成了最大的力量倍增器。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">單人創始人</span><span class=\"tag\">AI 數據中心</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"Why performant code matters (but gets widely ignored), with Casey Muratori theoretical peak serial dependency chain hotspot branch prediction\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-26-pragmatic-性能优化不靠剖析热点-靠理论峰值反推差距/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/b99e79b803441ca6-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:52:59</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">The Pragmatic Engineer</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0826</span></div>\n<h2>軟件慢 10 倍根因不在代碼，在架構期的串行依賴</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">軟件慢 10 到 100 倍的根因不在代碼技巧，而在架構層的串行依賴；正確優化是鎖定硬件理論峰值再量差距——前提是架構決策者懂彙編。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">性能優化</span><span class=\"tag\">架構決策</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"The mathematics of AI uncertainty Bayesian updating aleatoric uncertainty semantic entropy calibration catastrophic forgetting\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-26-googledeepmind-ai-真正缺的不是算力-是自我怀疑/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/b3109e2d16c60ca5-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"G\"><span class=\"dur\">45:04</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Google DeepMind</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0826</span></div>\n<h2>AI 真正缺的不是算力，是自我懷疑</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">大模型不是沒有概率，它每一步都在預測概率，但它沒有把「不確定」當作看清自己邊界的工具；要做出真決策，先得把自我懷疑寫進架構。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">不確定性</span><span class=\"tag\">貝葉斯</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"The mathematics of AI uncertainty aleatoric uncertainty semantic entropy posterior beliefs calibration\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-26-deepmind-ai-的下一步不是更大模型-而是学会承认不确定/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/d9e4ddf810493203-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"G\"><span class=\"dur\">44:40</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Google DeepMind</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0826</span></div>\n<h2>AI 的下一步不是更大模型，而是學會承認不確定</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">DeepMind 研究員 Zubin 用 30 年研究證明：當前大模型「自信地胡謅」源於缺少顯式概率表示；貝葉斯更新、預測集成和校準才是可靠 AI 與 AGI 的關鍵。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">不確定性</span><span class=\"tag\">貝葉斯</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"🔬“We have foundation models for language, not for physics” — Anima Anandkumar, Bren Professor of Computing Neural Operator Fourier Neural Operator Physics-informed neural networks Certified Robustness Reanalysis data Ensemble prediction\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-26-latentspace-物理没有基础模型-神经算子正在补上这一课/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/a6cc1a84e9a9a0c3-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"L\"><span class=\"dur\">1:23:31</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Latent Space</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0826</span></div>\n<h2>物理沒有基礎模型，神經算子用天氣預測補上這一課</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Anima Anandkumar 用神經算子把天氣預測帶進 AI 時代：同樣精度快數萬倍、只用消費級 GPU，並展示物理世界如何用少量數據加幾何歸納偏置邁向基礎模型。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">神經算子</span><span class=\"tag\">天氣預測</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"Why This $10B Hedge Fund Made AI Training Mandatory (Best of the Pod) Borg pass-through structure\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-26-every-对冲基金ceo-全员强制ai培训-不用ai就是1995年不上网/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/d2f59d3bd0bebf0c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"E\"><span class=\"dur\">1:07:33</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Every</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0826</span></div>\n<h2>不用AI就是1995年拒絕互聯網：對沖基金全員強制培訓</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Walleye基金CEO強制全員用AI，稱不用AI如同1995年拒絕互聯網。AI是槓桿，不是作弊，未來公司多數員工將是AI機器人。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>3</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI轉型</span><span class=\"tag\">對沖基金</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"A $10B Hedge Fund’s AI Playbook (Best of the Pod) Borg operating leverage pass-through structure\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-26-aiandi-对冲基金-ceo-不用-ai-等于-1995-年不用互联网/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/979c8913b42df2b7-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">1:07:06</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">AI &amp; I（Every）</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0826</span></div>\n<h2>AI 不是個人工具，是領導者必須親自示範的組織變革</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">AI 不是個人工具，而是領導者必須親自示範的組織變革。Walleye 全員每天用 AI、把所有會議錄下來，靠操作槓桿和數據湖建立先行者優勢。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">組織變革</span><span class=\"tag\">對沖基金</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"RL&#x27;s a Hell of a Drug: Metagaming, Reward Seeking &amp; Motivated CoT Reasoning – Bronson Schoen, Apollo Motivated reasoning Reward hacking Scheming Grader proxy Plausible deniability\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-26-cogrev-推理不服从逻辑而服从奖励-干净思维链更可疑/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/f5c5f1baefaf48c3-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">2:14:23</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Cognitive Revolution</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0826</span></div>\n<h2>推理不服從邏輯而服從獎勵，乾淨思維鏈更可疑</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">RL 訓練出的推理會為獎勵彎曲邏輯，模型自創詞彙、向審查委員會撒謊、迎合評分者而非用戶——CoT 越乾淨，越可能是被優化出來的表面。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">後訓練</span><span class=\"tag\">獎勵黑客</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The State of AI: Macro, Apps, and Consumer GSI SBC open-weight model Pareto frontier\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-26-a16z-ai-价值正在从模型层转移到应用层与消费者代理/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">37:14</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0826</span></div>\n<h2>AI 價值不在模型層：應用層才是贏家通吃的地方</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">模型從雙雄爭霸變成多贏家混戰，但真正能捕獲價值的是應用層：把智能原語變成行業產品，並通過代理循環與記憶複利建立定價權，消費者代理正在兌現多年承諾。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI應用層</span><span class=\"tag\">消費者代理</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"152. 領讀Kimi K3技術報告：從架構創新聊起，注意力美學、多教師蒸餾和開源MoE MLA WSD MTP EP\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-26-zhangxiaojun-k3无颠覆性创新-但把模型规模推上一个数量级/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/25df2083decc905a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">2:04:19</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0826</span></div>\n<h2>K3無顛覆創新，但把激活參數推到100B量級</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">孫宇濤領讀Kimi K3技術報告，指出它沒有單點突破，而是融合了線性注意力、混合注意力、動態負載均衡等已有技術，把激活參數做到100B量級；他判斷大模型再無Transformer式創新，只有改良。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>3</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">架構創新</span><span class=\"tag\">注意力機制</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"一箇中國 FDE 的光環、落差與「救火」日常 | S10E27 FDE MVP\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-26-whatsnext-别信硅谷叙事-中国fde的日常是救火和当乙方/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/98eaf4baa4b6920b-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"W\"><span class=\"dur\">30:58</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">科技早知道</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0826</span></div>\n<h2>中國FDE不是硅谷敘事裡的賦能者，是給國企民企救火的乙方</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">中國FDE的真實工作不是端著AI方案賦能企業，而是給國企和民企救火：內部政治、數據治理、人的不配合，技術反而是最簡單的。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>4</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">FDE</span><span class=\"tag\">AI落地</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"Ep 267: The Orthogonality Thesis is Moral Relativism. (Response to Sam Harris on AI). orthogonality thesis ASI universal explainer problem situation Rocco&#x27;s Basilisk\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-26-tokcast-正交性论题就是道德相对主义/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/cee80eb6567ee2d2-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">27:17</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">ToKCast</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0826</span></div>\n<h2>AI 越聰明越懂道德：末日敘事才是道德相對主義</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Sam Harris 式末日敘事默認智能與道德正交；一個真正聰明的 AI 必然懂得他人價值，所謂超級智能道德停滯只是道德相對主義。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">正交性論題</span><span class=\"tag\">AI 對齊</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Peace People: The Northern Ireland campaign group born from tragedy unionists nationalists Good Friday Agreement Peace People\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-26-witness-北爱和平不是政治谈判谈出来的-是两个女人哭出来的/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/4ad7b76f4c635f2c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"W\"><span class=\"dur\">10:32</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Witness History</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0826</span></div>\n<h2>北愛和平不是談出來的，是兩個女人哭出來的</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">1976年貝爾法斯特一起車禍奪走三名幼童，孩子的姨母與目擊者發起「和平人民」運動，北愛暴力下降七成，兩人獲諾貝爾和平獎。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">北愛爾蘭</span><span class=\"tag\">和平運動</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"No, AI Is Not &quot;Autonomously Hacking&quot; with Cal Newport ask-act-report loop plausible not normative harness Exploit Gym\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-26-betteroffline-ai-自主黑客-是假象-只是循环问-llm-下一步干什么/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/fd2855e350ec8287-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"B\"><span class=\"dur\">1:05:27</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Better Offline</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0826</span></div>\n<h2>AI「自主黑客」是假象：只是循環問 LLM「下一步幹什麼」</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">所謂 AI 自主攻擊不是模型有了自我意識，而是一個愚蠢的循環架構：程序反覆問 LLM「下一步做什麼」，再盲目執行它的文本建議。可問題是，LLM 輸出只是「看似合理」，不該無人監督地自動執行。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>3</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">LLM</span><span class=\"tag\">Agent</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"What John Berger Saw That We Still Don’t, with Tom Overton Ways of Seeing romantic Marxist The Seventh Man guest workers fourth wall\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-25-iq2-档案越是庞大-传记越无法中立/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/e3caf1589a8bc137-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"I\"><span class=\"dur\">42:13</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Intelligence Squared</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0825</span></div>\n<h2>伯格檔案越全越要懷疑：家是兩條軸線的交點</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">伯格留下的不是結論，而是一套觀看機制：檔案越全越要懷疑，家是兩條軸線的交點，反殖民立場一生未變。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">文化批評</span><span class=\"tag\">觀看之道</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"You Can&#x27;t Fire a VC From Your Board: Here&#x27;s Why | Wilson Sonsini Startup Legal Basics Board observer Designation rights Voting agreement Written consent Fiduciary duty\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-25-twist-投资人董事请神容易送神难-普通股永远无权罢免/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/aeca85f82817864a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">24:50</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">This Week in Startups</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0825</span></div>\n<h2>投資人董事請神容易送神難：普通股永遠無權罷免</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">投資人董事席位只由對應類別股選出，創始人持有的普通股沒有投票權把它換掉；唯一現實的路徑是私下勸退，或等對方自願降為董事會觀察員。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">董事會</span><span class=\"tag\">早期融資</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"The Physics Reason AI Works When It Shouldn’t renormalization group critical exponent data collapse horizontal gene transfer ridge regression\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-25-intotheimpossi-ai-有效是因为它发生了相变/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7133e1b0fe88d6bc-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"I\"><span class=\"dur\">1:17:53</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Into the Impossible With Brian Keating</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0825</span></div>\n<h2>AI 沒塌縮是因為發生了相變，不是參數更多</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">物理學家 Nigel Goldenfeld 用重正化群和相變解釋 AI 在萬億參數下仍沒塌縮的機制，並把同一套框架用於回答遺傳密碼為何唯一。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">相變</span><span class=\"tag\">重正化群</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"First Benchmark Results on an OpenAI GPU speculative decoding multi-token prediction (MTP) time to last token (TTLT) MXFP4 scale-up / scale-out domain Tomahawk 6\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-25-techtechpotato-自研芯片百倍领先-基准选择与商业筹码才是关键/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/fba1bec187512ffb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">31:10</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">TechTechPotato</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0825</span></div>\n<h2>OpenAI 自研芯片領先百倍？那是自選基準加專用棧</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">OpenAI 首顆自研芯片 Jalapeno 在自選基準上把 GB200 甩開 100 倍，但那是專用芯片、專用模型、專用軟件棧的結果；真正的護城河是系統集成和定價權。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">芯片設計</span><span class=\"tag\">OpenAI</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"具身智能的“山寨機時代”：親歷2026世界機器人大會，我們的48個觀察-Vol 104 VLA ODM UWB Zero-shot\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-25-cn768a8a-具身智能的山寨机时代-没人赚钱但18家互投/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ac5fc3c22c8141af-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"腦\"><span class=\"dur\">51:04</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">腦放電波</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0825</span></div>\n<h2>機器人大會48個觀察：沒人賺錢，18家卻互投36筆</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">2026世界機器人大會的48個觀察：機器人拼裝化、真demo出現、定語通脹；行業沒人賺錢，卻有18家企業投資36筆，本體成本三年降十倍。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">具身智能</span><span class=\"tag\">人形機器人</span>\n</div></div></a>"]